  "NROOT" [label="(0,0,0) The paper proposes NeuroBench as a community-driven, dual-track benchmark suite with open-source tooling and hierarchical task-level metrics to provide a standardized and extensible evaluation method for neuromorphic algorithms and hardware systems, thereby helping guide neuromorphic co-design.", fillcolor="lightyellow", style="filled"];
  "NROOT_COMMON" [label="(0,0,0) When a promising research area faces definitional, implementation, evolution, metric, and infrastructure challenges, a standardized, extensible benchmark suite with shared tools and task-level metrics can provide a practical basis for fair evaluation and co-design."];
